WEBVTT

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.425
and this woman said,

00:10:30.449 --> 00:10:33.726
"There's no way, with our history,

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.835
we could ever engage
in the systematic killing of human beings.

00:10:38.224 --> 00:10:40.787
It would be unconscionable for us

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.726
to, in an intentional and deliberate way,

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.873
set about executing people."

00:10:46.817 --> 00:10:48.184
And I thought about that.

00:10:48.962 --> 00:10:51.579
What would it feel like
to be living in a world

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:55.280
where the nation-state of Germany
was executing people,

00:10:55.304 --> 00:10:57.733
especially if they were
disproportionately Jewish?

00:10:57.757 --> 00:10:58.952
I couldn't bear it.

00:10:59.464 --> 00:11:01.662
It would be unconscionable.